{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログ開いて下さりありがとうございます🐈‍⬛"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46 増本綺良です🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日 24：15~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『ホリケンのみんなともだち』さんに出演させて頂きます🏠"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/ed2/d05edfa89ea73d5c506c0743d8e92.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とてもとてもお世話になった番組なので、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "卒業前にまたご一緒できて嬉しかったです🙌"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回はオープンハウスさんを社会科見学させて頂きました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今まで知らなかった細かい工夫などをたくさん学びました🏠"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今後物件を探す機会があればすごく活かせそうです✨️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひ観てください👀"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/ed2/d05edfa89ea73d5c506c0743d8e92-01.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "イヤリングいちばん大きいの選んだ👸🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この番組で私のお父さんとなって下さったホリケンさんですが、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この日は隙間時間の度に「キラ子今後どうするの〜」と、本当の父のように心配してくれました👨🏻笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "すごく楽しかったです🔎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "サクラミーツフェスのお気に入り写真。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/ed2/d05edfa89ea73d5c506c0743d8e92-02.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "昼の部のドラマに総合演出の金さんに出て頂きました♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とても無理なお願いをしてしまったなと思いますが、最後に一緒に作品を残すことができてとっっても嬉しかったです🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでくださりありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "増本綺良(きらこ)"}], "source": "official"}